[sliver] The 1.2 mm back wall sets the full-width lifting recess's entry height above the silicone apron. This recess provides under-edge purchase for lifting the seated cover and ends outside the bearing brim. The native cover slice has no support paths over this accessible edge; its physical finish remains unqualified.
alternatives: Filling the recess closes the under-edge purchase against the apron. A taller opening reduces the remaining plate section; increasing the entire plate thickness raises the cover exterior. Retain this local lifting clearance.
file: hardware/printed-parts/zone-c/funnel-cover/funnel-cover-print.step
